{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach and attempt to grab it. Then move to destination and check its properties. list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbed    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    />\"",
